NexusEdit Studio X — Mega-Mind v11
Architecture
Frontend GitHub Pages -> Nexus AI Gateway -> provider API.
Vercel environment variables
GEMINI_API_KEY (required for Gemini)
OPENAI_API_KEY (optional)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (optional)
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY (optional)
Never commit these secrets to GitHub.
Frontend configuration
Edit nexus-config.js and set: gatewayUrl: 'https://YOUR-VERCEL-PROJECT.vercel.app/api/nexus-ai'
The Mega-Mind panel also lets you enter this URL at runtime.
Health test
Open: https://YOUR-VERCEL-PROJECT.vercel.app/api/nexus-ai?health=1
Expected JSON contains ok: true.
What is real in this version
Real provider calls through the server gateway.
Gemini 3.8 Flash default.
Optional Google Search grounding for Gemini.
NexusCore planning.
Planner/creative/coder/video/image/audio/voice/reviewer/exporter agent routing.
Previous task outputs are passed into later tasks.
Chat history is passed into Gemini.
No provider API secret is stored in the frontend.
Not claimed as complete
Video/image/audio generation is still provider/tool dependent; the Mega-Mind text orchestration is the first production path to validate.
